  "about": [
    "We are an experimental team developing quantum simulators based on ultracold atoms in optical lattices and optical tweezer arrays. Our research focuses on topological physics, lattice gauge theories and out-of-equilibrium dynamics of strongly-interacting quantum many-body systems.",
    "The group is jointly located at the Max Planck Institute of Quantum Optics (MPQ) in Garching and the Faculty of Physics of the Ludwig-Maximilians-Universität München (LMU)."
  ],
